abstract: >-
  STRATA-Bench (Spatial-Temporal Retrieval, Alignment, Transparency & Audit)
  is a 39-task benchmark that measures whether AI agents can compile
  longitudinal market intelligence when public data is geographically nested,
  temporally gappy, and unit-inconsistent — without relabeling metro figures
  as downtown, silently interpolating, or plotting missing quarters on a
  categorical axis.
